<title>USA: Voice It Worldwide Q3 shr loss grows.</title>
<headline>Voice It Worldwide Q3 shr loss grows.</headline>
<dateline>FORT COLLINS, Colo 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voice It Worldwide, Inc.</p>
<p>			Condensed Statements of Operations</p>
<p>				     Three months ended September 30,</p>
<p>						1996		    1995</p>
<p> Net sales			   $2,203,294	    $2,952,843</p>
<p> Net loss			   (1,472,655)	     (741,605)</p>
<p> Loss per share			 ( 0.29)		 ( 0.16)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding     5,054,802	     4,592,882</p>
<p>					Nine months ended September 30,</p>
<p>						 1996		   1995</p>
<p> Net sales			    7,355,496	     9,449,497</p>
<p> Net loss			   (1,602,258)	     (815,889)</p>
<p> Loss per share			 ( 0.32)		 ( 0.18)</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding     5,054,802	     4,468,688</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is Voice It Worldwide Inc.</p>
<p>1996 Q3 net loss due to $1.4 million non-recurring, non-cash related charges including the end of the Message Center product line.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
